    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilizwe lesizwe sakoJuda ngosendo lwaso lalifika eningizimu emngceleni waseEdoma, enkangala yaseZini ngaseningizimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umngcele walo waseningizimu wawusuka ngasekupheleni koLwandle lweTshwayi, ngaseningizimu kwalo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uqonda eningizimu udlula umqanso waseAkirabimi, udlulela eZini; wasukhwela usuka eningizimu kweKadeshi‐Barneya, wagudla eHezironi waya eAdari, wasuphenduka eKarika, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waya eAzimoni, wafika esifuleni saseGibithe, waphelela olwandle. Lo wawuyiwo umngcele walo ngaseningizimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umngcele wasempumalanga wawuluLwandle lweTshwayi, kusiya ekungeneni kweJordani. Umngcele wasenyakatho wasuka ngasolwandle, ekungeneni kweJordani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waya ngaseBeti‐Hogila, wagudla enyakatho kweBeti‐Araba, wasukhwela uqonda ilitshe likaBohani indodana kaRubeni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wasukela esihotsheni saseAkori waqonda iDebiri, wasuphendukela enyakatho uqonda elizweni maqondana lomqanso waseAdumimi, ngaseningizimu kwesihotsha; wasudlula usiya ngasemanzini aseEni‐Shemeshi, waphelela eEni‐Rogeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wasukhwela ngesihotsha saseBeni‐Hinomu usiya eningizimu kwewatha lamaJebusi, okutsho iJerusalema. Wasukhwela usiya engqongeni yentaba ekhangelene lesihotsha saseBeni‐Hinomu ngasentshonalanga, ngasenyakatho ekupheleni kwesihotsha saseRefayimi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wasuka engqongeni yentaba waya emthonjeni wamanzi aseNefitowa, wasukela lapho waya emizini yasentabeni eEfroni; wasuphenduka uqonda eBala, okutsho iKiriyathi‐Jeyarimi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wasuka ngasentshonalanga kweBala waya entabeni yaseSeyiri, wadlula waya ngasenyakatho kwentaba yaseJeyarimi, okutsho iKesaloni, wehlela eBeti‐Shemeshi, wadlula eTimina, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wasuphuma uqonda iwatha lentaba ngasenyakatho kweEkroni, waphendukela eShikeroni, wadlula waqonda intaba yaseBala, waya eJabineli, wayaphelela ngasolwandle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umngcele wasentshonalanga wawuluLwandle olukhulu. Yiwo lowo umngcele ogombolozele isizwe sakoJuda losendo lwaso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njengokulaya kweNkosi kuJoshuwa wamnika uKalebi indodana kaJefune isabelo phakathi kwabakoJuda, iKiriyathi‐Arba, okutsho iHebroni; uArba wayenguyise kaAnaki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.1.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hlu 1:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.1.11+JDG.1.12+JDG.1.13+JDG.1.14+JDG.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hlu 1:11–15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UKalebi waxotsha lapho amadodana amathathu kaAnaki, uSheshayi loAhimani loTalimayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasuka lapho wahlasela abaseDebiri; kuqala iDebiri kwakuthiwa iKiriyathi‐Seferi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UKalebi wathi: Lowo ohlasela iKiriyathi‐Seferi, alithumbe, ngizamendisela uAkisa indodakazi yami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UOthiniyeli indodana kaKenazi, umnawakhe kaKalebi, walithumba; uKalebi wasemendisela uAkisa indodakazi yakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAkisa ekufikeni kwakhe kuye wamncenga ukuba amcelele insimu kuyise; uAkisa wasesehla kubabhemi wakhe, uKalebi wathi kuye: Ukhala ngani na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena wathi kuye: Akungiphe isipho, lokhu ungibeke elizweni elomileyo laseNegebi; ngiphe imithombo yamanzi. UKalebi wasemnika imithombo engaphezulu lengaphansi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
